kind: lemma (Lemma D.1 (Fresh-draw conditioning).)
Let $\Theta_{a}$ be $\widehat{\mathcal{F}}_{a}$-measurable, and let $Q$ be independent of $\mathcal{F}_{\mathrm{tr}}$. If $\widehat{\mathcal{F}}_{a}\subseteq\mathcal{H}\subseteq\mathcal{F}_{\mathrm{tr}}$, then every nonnegative measurable function $b$ satisfies


