The supremum is outside the probability in this display. For all sufficiently large $n$, $x\leq n$ as required by that proposition; the remaining finitely many $n$ are covered by increasing $C_{b}$.


To make the bound simultaneous over trajectories, we use that their parameter dimension $D=(L-1)q^{2}T$ is fixed. On $\mathcal{A}_{b}$, the same first-layer norm recursion as above, with $\|B\|\leq R$, yields


1.1.1/1.1.10/1.3.32


