Since $\|u_{B}^{(s+1)}-u_{B^{\prime}}^{(s+1)}\|_{\infty}\leq\sqrt{n}\|A\|_{\mathrm{op}}e_{s}$, finite iteration yields, after enlarging $C_{T}$,


