and let $D_{0},\ldots,D_{t-1}$ be the original arm-wise deterministic shifts from HI25 Definition -(S4). We use the convention $\Omega_{-1,j}=\Omega_{j,-1}=0$ for $j=-1,0,\ldots,t-1$, consistent with $\mathfrak{G}^{(0)}=0$. To realize the original Gaussian state evolution explicitly, first suppose $t\geq 1$ and let $(\mathfrak{G}^{(1)},\ldots,\mathfrak{G}^{(t)})\in(\mathbb{R}^{q})^{[1:t]}$ be centered jointly Gaussian with covariance blocks


