1.1.1/1.1.10/1.3.139


which is exactly the covariance specification in HI25 Definition -(S2) for the original arm-wise row-indexed state evolution. Moreover,


1.1.1/1.1.10/1.3.140


Thus, there is a centered jointly Gaussian extension


