For the last inequality, apply conditional Cauchy–Schwarz once more to $\mathcal{P}_{a,t}$ and the corresponding error in (1.1.1/1.1.11/1.3.23)– (1.1.1/1.1.11/1.3.26), using the comparison lemma at moment order $4r$. Increasing $C_{t,r}$ and summing over $j$ gives


