kind: proposition (Proposition F.3 (Weighted averages of corrected predictions).)
Assume the conditions of Section 1.1.1/1.1.9/1.1.1, with fixed $K,L,q,\mathcal{T}$. For every $a\in[K]$, $t\in\mathcal{T}$, and $r\geq 1$, on $E_{\mathrm{cnt}}$,


1.1.1/1.1.12/1.4.7


