\widehat{\mathcal{O}}_{a}^{(t)}(\Phi^{\mathrm{fit}})=\widehat{M}_{a,\mathrm{diag}}^{(t)},\qquad\mathcal{O}_{a,\pi}^{(t)}(\Phi^{\mathrm{fit}})=\mathbb{E}\left[w_{a}(Z)f_{W_{a}^{(t)}}(Z)\,|\,\widehat{\mathcal{F}}_{a}\right].@equation
