\displaystyle\leq\delta_{\mathrm{off}}+\delta_{\mathrm{diag}}=o_{p}(1).Equivalently,@equation
\widehat{\mathcal{V}}_{\mathrm{ADM}}(\mathbf{t})=\sum_{a=1}^{K}\mu(a)\left[\sum_{b\neq a}\mu(b)\,M_{b}^{(t_{b})}+\mu(a)\,M_{a}^{(t_{a})}\right]+o_{p}(1),uniformly over $\mathbf{t}\in\mathcal{T}^{K}$.Now@equation
\displaystyle\sum_{a=1}^{K}\mu(a)\sum_{b\neq a}\mu(b)\,M_{b}^{(t_{b})}Adding the logged-action term gives@equation
\sum_{a=1}^{K}\mu(a)\left[\sum_{b\neq a}\mu(b)\,M_{b}^{(t_{b})}+\mu(a)\,M_{a}^{(t_{a})}\right]=\sum_{a=1}^{K}\mu(a)\,M_{a}^{(t_{a})}.Finally,@equation
\displaystyle\sum_{a=1}^{K}\mu(a)\,M_{a}^{(t_{a})}@equation
