\displaystyle=\mathcal{V}_{g_{\mathbf{t}}}(\nu).The last equality is the definition of the policy value under the fitted reward model, conditional on the training data and initialization. Substituting (1.1.1/1.1.14/1.1.65) into (1.1.1/1.1.14/1.1.56) proves the uniform ADM claim.### ADR.For $i\in\mathcal{I}_{a}$, the ADR summand satisfies@equation
