\displaystyle\quad=\sum_{b\neq a}\mu(b)w_{b}(X_{i})f_{W_{b}^{(t_{b})}}(X_{i})+w_{a}(X_{i})R_{i}+\{\mu(a)-1\}w_{a}(X_{i})c_{i,a}^{(t_{a})}@equation
\displaystyle\quad=\sum_{b\neq a}\mu(b)w_{b}(X_{i})f_{W_{b}^{(t_{b})}}(X_{i})+w_{a}(X_{i})R_{i}-\{1-\mu(a)\}w_{a}(X_{i})c_{i,a}^{(t_{a})}.Here we used $\nu(b\,|\,x)=\mu(b)w_{b}(x)$ and $\nu(a\,|\,x)-w_{a}(x)=-\left(1-\mu(a)\right)w_{a}(x)$ for the observed arm. Summing within each $\mathcal{I}_{a}$ and then over $a$ gives@equation
\widehat{\mathcal{V}}_{\mathrm{ADR}}(\mathbf{t})=\sum_{a=1}^{K}\frac{N_{a}}{m}\left[\sum_{b\neq a}\mu(b)\,\overline{M}_{a,b}^{(t_{b})}+\overline{R}_{a}-\left(1-\mu(a)\right)\widehat{M}_{a,\mathrm{diag}}^{(t_{a})}\right].Define@equation
T_{\mathrm{ADR}}(\mathbf{t})\coloneqq\sum_{a=1}^{K}\mu(a)\left\{\sum_{b\neq a}\mu(b)M_{b}^{(t_{b})}+R_{a}^{\star}-\{1-\mu(a)\}M_{a}^{(t_{a})}\right\}.Subtracting $T_{\mathrm{ADR}}(\mathbf{t})$ from (1.1.1/1.1.14/1.1.73) yields@equation
