\displaystyle\qquad+\sum_{a=1}^{K}\left\{\frac{N_{a}}{m}-\mu(a)\right\}\{R_{a}^{\star}-M_{a}^{(t_{a})}\}.Here the common term $\sum_{b}\mu(b)M_{b}^{(t_{b})}$ again cancels from the second sum. For $0<\eta<1/2$, the count bound and $B_{M}=d^{o_{p}(1)}$ give@equation
