1.1.1/1.1.14/1.3.17


where $\Delta_{a}=\sup_{t\in\mathcal{T}}|\widehat{\mathcal{E}}_{a}^{(t)}-\mathcal{E}_{a,\mathrm{ind}}^{(t)}|$.@equation
