\mathcal{J}_{\mathrm{DR}}(g_{\mathbf{t}})=\sum_{a=1}^{K}\frac{1-\mu(a)}{\mu(a)}\mathcal{R}_{\nu,a}^{\circ}(g_{a,t_{a}}),Thus, the selection guarantee controls an upper bound on the excess variance of a DR score evaluated on an independent observation.See 1.1.1/1.1.4/1.3.26@proof
Proof.
