\displaystyle\sup_{\mathbf{t}\in\mathcal{T}^{K}}\left\lvert\widehat{\mathcal{V}}_{\mathrm{ADR}}(\mathbf{t})-\mathcal{V}(\nu)\right\rvert@proof
Proof of 1.1.1/1.1.15/1.1.5.
