Applying this bound to the two errors yields


$$\displaystyle\max_{a\in[K]}\sup_{t\in\mathcal{T}}|\widehat{\mathcal{E}}_{a}^{(t)}-\mathcal{E}_{a,\pi}^{(t)}|$$




We next use the exact noise identity (1.1.1/1.1.12/1.3.12). Since $\varkappa_{\ast,a}$ contains the maximum realized arm-wise noise, (1.1.1/1.1.15/1.1.3) with $s=2,4$ implies


