caption: Value estimation for identical reward models selected by the corrected criterion, with $m=2d$. Left: empirical bias of DR and ADR relative to the true target-policy value. Right: RMSE of DM, ADM, and cross-arm DM relative to the population value induced by the fitted model in each dataset. Bars give pointwise $95\%$ Monte Carlo intervals over 200 datasets per dimension.<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" version="1.1" width="490.73695pt" height="191.52223pt" viewBox="0 0 490.73695 191.52223">
