</svg>@figure
kind: algorithm
caption: Arm-wise Onsager post-processing
1:


 Arm-wise rewards $\{R_{i}:i\in\mathcal{I}_{a}\}$ and trajectory
$\{W_{a}^{(r)},\widetilde{U}_{a}^{(r)},\Psi_{a}^{(r)}\}_{r=0}^{T}$,
first-layer step sizes $\{\eta_{a,1}^{(r)}\}_{r=0}^{T-1}$, and $\phi_{a}$
2:


 $\widehat{\bm{\rho}}_{a}^{[0]}\leftarrow\emptyset$ and
$\widehat{U}_{a}^{(0)}\leftarrow\widetilde{U}_{a}^{(0)}$; set
$\widehat{\bm{L}}_{a,k}^{[-1]},Q_{a,k}^{[0]}\leftarrow\emptyset$ for every $k$
3:


 for $t=1,\ldots,T$ do
4:


   for $k=1,\ldots,N_{a}$ do
5:


    Compute $J_{i_{a,k},a}^{(t-1)}$ and append
$\eta_{a,1}^{(t-1)}J_{i_{a,k},a}^{(t-1)}$ to the cached block diagonal
$\widehat{\bm{L}}_{a,k}^{[t-2]}$
6:


    Set $B_{a,k}^{[t]}\leftarrow I_{t,q}+\phi_{a}^{-1}\widehat{\bm{L}}_{a,k}^{[t-1]}\mathfrak{O}_{t}(\widehat{\bm{\rho}}_{a}^{[t-1]})$
7:


    Extend the cached solution $Q_{a,k}^{[t-1]}$ by computing only
the new block row of
$B_{a,k}^{[t]}Q_{a,k}^{[t]}=\widehat{\bm{L}}_{a,k}^{[t-1]}$
by block forward substitution
8:


   end for
9:


   $\widehat{\bm{\tau}}_{a}^{[t]}\leftarrow-N_{a}^{-1}\sum_{k=1}^{N_{a}}Q_{a,k}^{[t]}$
10:


   Extend the cached $\widehat{\bm{\rho}}_{a}^{[t-1]}$ by computing
the new block row of $\widehat{\bm{\rho}}_{a}^{[t]}$ from the recursion above
11:


   Form $\widehat{U}_{a}^{(t)}$ from
(1.1.1/1.1.3/1.2.7)
12:


 end for
13:


 Use $\{\widehat{U}_{a}^{(t)}\}_{t=0}^{T}$ in
(1.1.1/1.1.3/1.3.5); after arm-wise selection, compute
(1.1.1/1.1.3/1.3.13)–(1.1.1/1.1.3/1.3.15)@figure
kind: table
